  "notes": "Chipotles in adobo come in small cans from Mexican or well-stocked supermarkets. Swap: 1 tsp smoked chili flakes plus 1 tsp smoked paprika.\nMeal prep: rolled burritos wrapped in foil freeze well; reheat in the oven at 200 °C for 25 minutes.\n\nHealthier swap: make it a burrito bowl (no tortilla, about 290 kcal less), use Skyr instead of sour cream, chicken breast and a wholegrain tortilla.\n\nNutrition is estimated per burrito.",
