   "Add the rest of the oil, then the spring onion whites, garlic and peas/carrot for 30 seconds.",
   "Add the rice and stir fry over the highest heat for 3 to 4 minutes, pressing and tossing so every grain gets hot and slightly toasty.",
   "Season with salt, sugar, white pepper and MSG, then drizzle the soy sauce around the hot edge of the wok (not onto the rice) and toss.",
   "Return the egg, break it up, add the spring onion greens and sesame oil, toss once more and serve."
