  "notes": "Grünkohl tastes best reheated the next day, so it's worth making a double batch. Frozen kale is already blanched, which is why 45 minutes is enough.\n\nHealthier swap: use lean Kassler loin instead of Pinkel or Mettwurst (about 250 kcal less), skip the lard, and serve boiled potatoes instead of fried ones.\n\nNutrition is estimated with one sausage per person.",
