   "Add the carrots and potatoes, pour in the water and bring to a boil. Skim, cover and simmer for 15 minutes until the vegetables are tender.",
   "Turn off the heat. Break the curry roux into pieces and stir until it dissolves completely (adding it off the heat prevents lumps).",
