  "notes": "The mix of Bergkäse (flavour) and Emmentaler (stretch) is the classic Allgäu combo. A little Weißlacker makes it even funkier.\n\nHealthier swap: use 150 g strong Bergkäse instead of 250 g cheese and stir 150 g Skyr or cottage cheese with a ladle of cooking water through the spätzle for creaminess. Make the onions in the air fryer with 1 tsp oil. Always serve with a big salad.\n\nNutrition is estimated.",
