   "Mix the crushed cornflakes with the sesame seeds and a pinch of salt, then press the chicken into the crumbs on both sides.",
   "Air-fry at 200 °C for 12 to 15 minutes (or bake at 200 °C for 20 minutes), turning once, until golden and cooked through.",
   "For the sauce, soften the carrot and onion in a pan with a little oil spray and a splash of water for 5 minutes. Add the garlic and ginger, turmeric and curry powder and stir for 1 minute until fragrant.",
